workflow 百鬼夜行_采集
  version: 6.0.0
  description: 在已进入的百鬼夜行画面中采集完整截图，供标注训练。
  resolution: [1920, 1080]
  root: root_1
  inputs: {}
  variables: {}
  node root_1 root 入口
    at: [0, 0]
  node sample task 采集训练截图
    at: [0, 180]
    action: vision.capture_dataset
    params:
      count: 100
      interval_seconds: 0.2
  edges:
    root_1 -> sample
